Gemini Notebook API | Google for Developers

 Gemini Notebook API

The Gemini Notebook API is a REST interface for programmatically creating and managing notebooks and sources in Gemini Notebook. Ingest web pages, YouTube videos, plain text, Markdown, and uploaded files (such as PDFs, documents, audio, and images) into persistent notebooks.

Early Access Public Preview: The Gemini Notebook API and MCP server are in an early access Public Preview, and we're actively working on our roadmap. We'd love to hear what you want the API and MCP server to do. Please file feature requests in our Issue Tracker. We're excited to build this out, and there's more to come!

During the preview, the API is available for personal Google Accounts. Google Workspace accounts are not yet supported.

Just want to get started? Go to the Quickstart, copy the setup prompt, and give it to your coding agent.

```
import requests

API = "https://notebook.googleapis.com/v1"
headers = {
    "Authorization": f"Bearer {ACCESS_TOKEN}",
    "x-goog-user-project": PROJECT_ID,
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
}

# 1. Create a notebook
nb = requests.post(f"{API}/notebooks", headers=headers, json={
    "display_name": "My Research"
}).json()

# 2. Add a source
requests.post(f"{API}/{nb['name']}/sources", headers=headers, json={
    "display_name": "Gemini API Guide",
    "web_content": {"url": "https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs"}
})

```

```
const API = "https://notebook.googleapis.com/v1";
const headers = {
  "Authorization": `Bearer ${ACCESS_TOKEN}`,
  "x-goog-user-project": PROJECT_ID,
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
};

// 1. Create a notebook
const nb = await (await fetch(`${API}/notebooks`, {
  method: "POST",
  headers,
  body: JSON.stringify({ display_name: "My Research" })
})).json();

// 2. Add a source
await fetch(`${API}/${nb.name}/sources`, {
  method: "POST",
  headers,
  body: JSON.stringify({
    display_name: "Gemini API Guide",
    web_content: { url: "https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs" }
  })
});

```

```
# 1. Create a notebook
NOTEBOOK=$(curl -s -X POST "https://notebook.googleapis.com/v1/notebooks" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN" \
  -H "x-goog-user-project: $PROJECT_ID" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"display_name": "My Research"}')

NOTEBOOK_NAME=$(echo "$NOTEBOOK" | python3 -c "import sys, json; print(json.load(sys.stdin)['name'])")

# 2. Add a source
curl -s -X POST "https://notebook.googleapis.com/v1/${NOTEBOOK_NAME}/sources" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN" \
  -H "x-goog-user-project: $PROJECT_ID" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "display_name": "Gemini API Guide",
    "web_content": {"url": "https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs"}
  }'

```

